S3 a wide-temperature 18650, the HL18650V (Yichun Topwell Power Co., Ltd; Yichun Topwell Power HL18650V product page (a maker's page, not a specification), reading v2/docs/records/l4e10/inputs/topwell-hl18650v-page-2026-10-01.json, page sha256 25dd8ee2d51eef91): discharge -40 to 85 C, charge -20 to 60 C (reduced rates below +10 C),
