Cycle terms: 35E 60 % (2,010 mAh) after 500 cycles, charge 1,020 mA, discharge 3,400 mA (MAKER 7.9); 30Q6 60 % (1,770 mAh) after 250 cycles, charge 4 A, discharge 15 A (MAKER 3.10; harsher conditions, not comparable); HL18650V at least 500 times (25 C, 0.5 C / 1C) (INFERRED, page).
