LO-01a CONDITIONAL (evidence MAKER+MODELED+INFERRED+ASSUMPTION)
   acceptance, complete: E3-A and E3-L with the pack fitted at +40 C, first on the pack, then on shore: every cell at or under +60 C and the +59 C abort, H1 not acting, the inside air at or under the SGP41's +55 C, F2's body at or under +60 C, the stage's bearers passing traffic (REQ-052), C1 to C3 and K2 at their triggers, no permanent protection action
   route CONDITIONAL: the enclosure's measured conductance. the complete pass line holds on the model from 1.666 W/K (SGP41 inside air at most +55 C, on shore), lid open and lid closed with fans. Missing: T-H1's reading in both lid states
   route CONDITIONAL: the pocket coupling measure. lowers the cells only (the +60 C rating and the +59 C abort); the air criteria (SGP41, F2) stay the enclosure's. Missing: the film and filler figures, board B's underside
   gap: T-H1 reading at least 1.666 W/K in each lid state, BANK-R1 in board B's generator, F2's body (P13), the gauge's ADC and gradient terms (P14); HIGH heat is not covered
LO-01b NO_COLLISION (evidence MAKER+MODELED)
   acceptance, complete: E4-O with the pack fitted: every cell at or above -10 C once warm
   gap: none
LO-01c NO_COLLISION (evidence MAKER+MODELED)
   acceptance, complete: E3-A's T3, T4 and OTC lines; E4-O's charge floor and the panel's hold
