   route REJECTED: thermal design without added power (fans, spreading, insulation, the coupling). the cells may sit 5 K over +55 C against a 6.63 to 19.22 K rise; insulation needs 6.7 to 13.7 mm against at most 2.66 mm; with the coupling the cells pass H1's reading at every corner, so the hot stop stops every module (E3-O's 'no shutdown'). Missing: none
   route INCONCLUSIVE: powered cooling of the pack on the input. cold-side load 0.76 to 7.87 W; with its heat sent out through the pack's skin path it needs 0.051 to 0.525 W/K at COP 1.0 against 0.054 to 0.090 W/K. Missing: a cooler's maker sheet (load against lift, COP), the input's spare power during E3-O, the volume, a sealed path out of the case for the worst corner
   route INCONCLUSIVE: a cell whose maker's sheet covers the level, with the protection and control redesign as its entry cost (section 4). the 30Q6's surface rating (80 C) covers the cells, its ambient line (60 C) does not unless read as the outside air; the HL18650V's page reaches 85 C. Missing: a maker's signed specification covering the level (none held; the HL18650V's page is not one), or Samsung's reading of the 30Q6's ambient clause, F2's replacement, U2 and the hot-stop thresholds re-derived
